
ROUGH EHR MODEL SKETCH
past 24h EHR + glucose history -> interpretable multitask head -> future glucose distribution + theta=P(glucose>180 mg/dL)
Loss = Gaussian NLL(future glucose - current glucose) + 0.5 * class-balanced BCE(theta) + 0.005 * L2; Adam learning_rate=0.02.
Prediction time: 6h ahead (accepted target window +/-3h).
Scope: hospital laboratory glucose, not a CGM or treatment recommendation.

